===Etymology===
Initialism originally from {{bor|tl|en|GI|pos=nickname for [[USA|U.S.]] military personnel|lit=general issue; government issue}}. The words to the {{initialism|tl||nocap=1}} was later jokingly perceived as "{{m|en|[[genuine#English|'''G'''enuine]] [[Intsik#Tagalog|'''I'''ntsik]]}}", from {{com|en|genuine|lang1=en|Intsik|t2=[[Chinese]]|lang2=tl|nocat=1}}. See also {{ncog|nan-hbl|[[正]][[咱人]]|tr=chiàⁿ lán-nâng|t=true Chinese; proper Chinese; straight Chinese; authentic Chinese; pure Chinese}}.

